==Notes==
*As with all beneficial spells, the effects of this spell are removed as soon as the caster or target ''begins'' [[rest]]ing. If the target's remaining [[hit point]]s are less than the bonus provided by the higher constitution [[modifier]] when such resting occurs, the target will die.
*If the maximum constitution increase is not achieved, the spell can be cast again for a chance at a higher die roll (up to +5 regularly or +7 [[empower spell|empowered]]). The recast will not lower the ability score.

